{
  "name": "Glowra 01 - Ambil Data Produk dari API Publik",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 · Ambil data produk dari API publik\n\n**Alur:** Klik tombol → minta data ke API (GET) → pecah jadi 1 item per produk → ambil kolom yang penting saja.\n\n**API:** https://dummyjson.com/products/category/beauty (gratis, tanpa API key, data contoh).\n\n**Cara tes:** klik **Execute workflow** di bawah, lalu klik node terakhir untuk melihat hasilnya.\n\n**Kurs** USD→IDR di node *Ambil Kolom Penting* = **asumsi Rp16.000**, ubah sesuai kurs terbaru.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1f0c001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Catatan Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1f0c001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Klik untuk Mulai",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://dummyjson.com/products/category/beauty",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f0c001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "GET Produk Beauty",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "products",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f0c001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Pecah per Produk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "id_produk",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "nama_produk",
              "value": "={{ $json.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "brand",
              "value": "={{ $json.brand }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "harga_usd",
              "value": "={{ $json.price }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
              "name": "harga_idr_estimasi",
              "value": "={{ Math.round($json.price * 16000) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
              "name": "stok",
              "value": "={{ $json.stock }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
              "name": "status_stok",
              "value": "={{ $json.stock < 40 ? 'RESTOCK' : 'AMAN' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
              "name": "diambil_pada",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f0c001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Ambil Kolom Penting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [720, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### (Opsional) Tulis ke Google Sheets\nNode di bawah **dinonaktifkan**. Untuk memakainya:\n1. Klik 2x node → buat **Credential** Google Sheets (login Google).\n2. Isi **Document** = URL spreadsheet kamu, **Sheet** = `Produk_API` (buat dulu tab ini, baris 1 berisi judul kolom: id_produk, nama_produk, brand, harga_usd, harga_idr_estimasi, stok, status_stok, diambil_pada).\n3. Klik kanan node → **Activate**.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1f0c001-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Catatan Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, -320]
    },
    {
